<h4>B. The Timeline of Revelation</h4>
<p>Draw a horizontal line on a large sheet of paper. Mark the following moments: Adam and Eve, Noah, Abraham, Moses and the Covenant at Sinai, the prophets, Jesus Christ, the apostolic Church, today (you). Write next to each one what God reveals at that moment. Reflect: the line continues. You are on it. Where do you think God is leading you next?</p>

<h4>C. Dialogue with Saint Paul</h4>
<p>Read the account of Saint Paul's conversion in Acts 9:1-19 (or 22:1-21). Imagine you are a journalist interviewing Paul shortly after his encounter with Christ. Write five questions you would ask him, and then answer them as you think he would respond.</p>
