<h3>5. Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, you who spoke to Moses from the burning bush,<br />
and to Saint Paul on the road to Damascus,<br />
speak to me as well.<br />
Open my ears to hear your voice,<br />
my eyes to recognize your passing,<br />
and my heart to answer like Moses: &laquo;Here I am.&raquo;<br />
You who are the eternal Word of the Father,<br />
teach me to know you and love you.<br />
Give me a hunger for your Scripture<br />
and a trust in the Church you founded.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

<p><strong>Prayer with Scripture:</strong> This week, before you scroll on your phone or check social media, open your Bible app or a physical Bible for 3 minutes first. Read one short passage. Write here which passages you read each day:</p>
