<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will try <em>lectio divina</em> (Activity D) at least twice this week with a different short passage each time.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will read one chapter of a Gospel each day. Start with Mark (the shortest). That's about 5 minutes a day.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will ask a priest, catechist, or knowledgeable friend to explain something about the Bible or Tradition that I've never understood.</p>
</div>

<div class="question-block">
<p class="question-block__q"><input type="checkbox" /> I will pay attention during the Liturgy of the Word at Mass this Sunday. Write down the readings beforehand (check the missal or an app) and read them before Mass.</p>
